      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Arboretum - 5 Star Tree Hotel\n\n- A large oak tree that hosts squirrel visitors.\n- Background is a picture of the oak tree, gently scrolls down the tree as you scroll down the page.\n- Navigation moves between branches between site pages\n- Display what a real hotel would advertise; different types of rooms, amenities, food services, events, local attractions, vouchers\n- Add history, location, contact details, prices, newsletter\n- Consider different browsers, resolutions, devices, & accessibility.",
      "fontSize": 27.576793574879048,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Arboretum - 5 Star Tree Hotel\n\n- A large oak tree that hosts squirrel visitors.\n- Background is a picture of the oak tree, gently scrolls down the tree as you scroll down the page.\n- Navigation moves between branches between site pages\n- Display what a real hotel would advertise; different types of rooms, amenities, food services, events, local attractions, vouchers\n- Add history, location, contact details, prices, newsletter\n- Consider different browsers, resolutions, devices, & accessibility.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "jQ2IDnweywGougFuYqffV",
