      "updated": 1758998344729,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Create planning analysis sheet, sitemap & wireframe.\n2. Create html for each page, add general strokes of what each page is for.\n3. Create css for each page with placeholder files.\n4. Revisit each page to get both html & css right.\n5. Add finishing touches.\n6. Review with Silktide for accessibility changes.",
      "fontSize": 31.82718997054291,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Create planning analysis sheet, sitemap & wireframe.\n2. Create html for each page, add general strokes of what each page is for.\n3. Create css for each page with placeholder files.\n4. Revisit each page to get both html & css right.\n5. Add finishing touches.\n6. Review with Silktide for accessibility changes.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
